	(text "Only GPIOs a CM4 has on the same numbers (ARCHITECTURE.md 9.1). The Pi 3V3 pins stay unconnected.\nThe Pi is powered from the board +5 V through pins 2 and 4: never plug the Pi USB-C supply at the same time.\nLink: UART0 (GPIO14/15), SPI0 for DMD frames, I2S to the DAC, RUN / BOOTSEL / SWD to the RP2354B, IRQ back."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 12.7 0)
